sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Usuário<br/>(Proprietário)
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BFF as BFF Gateway
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant QW as Queue Worker
    participant OC as Offchain<br/>Consumer
    participant BC as Blockchain<br/>(Besu)
    participant EL as Event<br/>Listener

    User->>FE: Preenche formulário de registro<br/>{matriculaId, endereço, metragem, ...}
    FE->>BFF: POST /api/properties/register<br/>{matriculaId, proprietario, ...}
    BFF->>Orch: Proxy: POST /properties/register<br/>+ JWT validation

    Orch->>Orch: Validar dados de entrada<br/>(matricula única, campos obrigatórios)
    Orch->>DB: SELECT * FROM properties<br/>WHERE matricula_id = ?
    DB-->>Orch: Not found

    Orch->>DB: INSERT INTO properties<br/>(matricula_id, proprietario, ...)<br/>status = PENDENTE
    DB-->>Orch: Property ID created

    Orch->>MQ: Publish REGISTER_PROPERTY job<br/>{propertyId, matriculaId, beneficiary, ...}
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE properties<br/>SET status = PROCESSANDO_REGISTRO

    Orch-->>BFF: 201 Created<br/>{propertyId, status: "PROCESSANDO_REGISTRO"}
    BFF-->>FE: Property registration initiated
    FE-->>User: "Propriedade em processamento.<br/>Aguardando confirmação na blockchain..."

    Note over MQ,OC: === Processamento Assíncrono ===

    MQ-->>QW: Consume REGISTER_PROPERTY job
    QW->>OC: POST /api/properties/register<br/>{matriculaId, beneficiary, ...}

    OC->>OC: Build transaction:<br/>requestPropertyRegistration(<br/>  matricula,<br/>  beneficiary<br/>)
    OC->>BC: Submit transaction to Besu
    BC-->>OC: Transaction Hash: 0xabc123...

    BC->>BC: Mine transaction<br/>(QBFT consensus)
    BC->>BC: Calculate requestHash:<br/>keccak256(beneficiary, matricula)
    BC->>BC: Store in pendingRegistrations[requestHash]
    BC->>BC: **Emit RegistrationRequested**<br/>{requestHash, matricula, beneficiary, requester}

    BC-->>EL: Event detected

    EL->>EL: Parse event:<br/>- event.args[0] = requestHash<br/>- event.args[1] = matricula<br/>- event.transactionHash
    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/.../registration-requested<br/>{requestHash, matriculaId, beneficiary, txHash}

    Orch->>DB: UPDATE properties<br/>SET request_hash = ?,<br/>    blockchain_tx_hash = ?<br/>WHERE matricula_id = ?
    DB-->>Orch: Updated
    Orch-->>EL: 200 OK

    Note over User,BC: **STATUS ATUAL:**<br/>- Propriedade: PROCESSANDO_REGISTRO<br/>- request_hash: preenchido<br/>- Aguardando 3 aprovações (parte 2)
